-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MLX (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The f16/bf16 "steel" GEMM kernels (metal_pjrt/kernels/steel_gemm.metal) are
ported from mlx/backend/metal/kernels/steel/gemm/{loader,mma,gemm}.h; the
small-M "wide gemv" kernel (metal_pjrt/kernels/gemv.metal) from
mlx/backend/metal/kernels/gemv.h, and its plan and the steel tile rules
(metal_pjrt/blas/gemv.cc, steel_gemm.cc) from mlx/backend/metal/matmul.cpp
(MLX 0.32.2); the convolution kernels (metal_pjrt/kernels/steel_conv.metal,
conv_misc.metal) from mlx/backend/metal/kernels/steel/conv/ and
kernels/conv.metal, and their paths and tile rules (metal_pjrt/conv/) from
mlx/backend/metal/conv.cpp (MLX 0.32.2); the FFT kernels
(metal_pjrt/kernels/fft.metal) from
mlx/backend/metal/kernels/{fft.h,fft/radix.h,fft/readwrite.h}, and the FFT
plan (metal_pjrt/fft/) from mlx/backend/metal/fft.cpp (MLX 0.32.2).

