  sources XLA compiles (src/ducc0/fft, and parts of src/ducc0/infra and
  src/ducc0/math), are dual-licensed BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0-or-later. This
  distribution elects BSD-3-Clause. The files' headers carry copyright notices
  of the Max-Planck-Society (2010-2024), Peter Bell (2019-2023) and Matteo
  Frigo and the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (2003, 2007-14; odd-sized
  DCT-IV transforms), all under the terms reproduced here from fft1d_impl.h.
